---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { SITE } from "../consts";
---
<BaseLayout title={`About — ${SITE.name}`}>
  <main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-5 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6 text-slate-900 dark:text-white">About</h1>
    <div class="post-content">
      <p>I work full time as a Solutions Architect based in Luxembourg.</p>
      <p>{SITE.intro}</p>
      <h2>Personal writing and projects</h2>
      <p>This blog and projects such as Agent Sentinel are independent personal pursuits that I work on in my spare time, alongside my full-time role.</p>
      <h2>Where this started</h2>
      <p>I've been writing about technology since 2007. Back then the questions were "Is Big Data Analytics really <em>big</em>?" and "SQL vs NoSQL." Nearly two decades later I'm architecting the AI platforms those debates were pointing toward. The early archive lives on at <a href={SITE.archive} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Eternal Quest</a> — same curiosity, different scale.</p>
      <p>Find me on <a href={SITE.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>, or reach out at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
